        "text": "Charles Hoelter is committed to transparency. View his official campaign filings here.\n- Home\n- About Me\n- Top News\n- Economy & Inflation\n- Endoresements\nContact Us\n# Safer communities and support for law enforcement\n# Safer communities and support for law enforcement\n## Our Plan for Change\nCharles Hoelter is running because Americans deserve leadership that is honest, strong, and focused on results. The campaign is built around real issues that impact families every day — inflation, crime, border security, education, and government accountability.\n### Economic Growth\nCharles will fight for lower taxes, reduced government spending, and pro-business policies that create jobs and increase opportunity.\n### Public Safety\nCrime is rising across the nation. Charles supports law enforcement and believes in policies that protect communities and hold criminals accountable.\n### Secure Borders\nCharles believes immigration should be legal, fair, and controlled. A secure border is a national security issue and must be treated as one\n### Education and Parental Rights\nParents deserve a voice in their children’s education. Charles\nsupports strong schools, transparency, and a curriculum that\nprepares students for success.\n### Constitutional Rights\nCharles will always defend the Constitution, including freedom of speech, religious liberty, and the right to bear arms.\n## Help Us Win\nThere are many ways you can support the campaign.\nDonate\nVolunteer",
